    dcat:downloadURL <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LeonardoRyuta/ontouml-models/master/LeonardoRyuta2023Ontology for Scientific Publishing/ontology.json>.
<http://purl.org/ontouml-models/dataset/LeonardoRyuta2023Ontology for Scientific Publishing/> dcat:distribution <http://purl.org/ontouml-models/dataset/LeonardoRyuta2023Ontology for Scientific Publishing/distribution/vpp>.
